OL,3,GNEWSAGPS collars making shepherds'
OL,4,Alives 'much easier'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGPS collars are changing the way
OL,7,Fanimals grazing on Jersey's cliffsides
OL,8,Fare managed, local shepherds have said.
OL,10,FConservation initiative The Grazing
OL,11,FProject has pioneered use of the
OL,12,Fcollars on large flocks of sheep, with
OL,13,Fits efforts so successful it is now
OL,14,Ftraining four grazing cows to use the
OL,15,Fcollars too.
OL,17,FIn 2025, the technology was featured on
OL,18,FClarkson's Farm, Jeremy Clarkson's
OL,19,Ffly-on-the-wall documentary about his
OL,20,FCotswolds farm Diddly Squat, where it
OL,21,Fwas used to contain his herd of goats.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
