OL,3,GNEWSAGPS collars making shepherds'
OL,4,Alives 'much easier'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey brothers and shepherds Josh and
OL,7,FBen Voak, who work with the project,
OL,8,Fsaid it had saved them hours of manual
OL,9,Flabour and opened up new areas for
OL,10,Fflocks to graze.
